; xinput1_3.dll exports, with their ordinals (100 = XInputGetStateEx, unnamed in the real DLL).
EXPORTS
    XInputGetState @2
    XInputSetState @3
    XInputGetCapabilities @4
    XInputEnable @5
    XInputGetDSoundAudioDeviceGuids @6
    XInputGetBatteryInformation @7
    XInputGetKeystroke @8
    XInputGetStateEx @100 NONAME
    GetInstance
